    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d2e0f97e8071865c9bf29f3e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "训练员，\n我一定要在“橡树大赛”拿第一名！\n身为一个公主，当然要赢下这场比赛～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "768c45831cd8b601840b97b946a8691200e871c30041b935b6efb19efe30df71",
